WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.683
Open Interaction Center, Management, Skills.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:09.592
The list shows the skills that exist.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:11.080
Click Add Skill.

00:00:11.643 --> 00:00:16.703
Enter a Name, such as Tier 2 support, and an optional Description.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.982
Leave Enabled ticked and click Save.

00:00:20.982 --> 00:00:25.338
A disabled skill stays on the agents and queues that already use it,

00:00:25.338 --> 00:00:27.870
but it cannot be picked for new ones.

